# Binary REAPER extensions shipped with the custom config.
#
# One filename per line, exactly as it appears in ~/.config/REAPER/UserPlugins.
# update-custom-config.sh copies only these from the live install; all other
# UserPlugins binaries are left out. setup-reaper-config.sh deploys them when
# the custom config is applied (P in Setup) and never removes them on revert.
#
# NEVER list extensions managed by the modules (they would be overwritten with
# stale binaries): reaper_reapack-*.so, reaper_sws-*.so, reaper_imgui-*.so.
reaper_playhead-x64.so
